4,1,,status,Minako,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Minato,,Hi everyone! I'm happy to help figure this out. I want to make sure the new fee structure is fair for everyone and doesn't make things too hard for whoever has to manage the money.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"We should be practical. Before we suggest any changes, we need to understand the actual financial state of the club and the administrative workload involved. Let's look at the data first to avoid making decisions based on guesswork.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,I agree with Ryuji. We need a clear understanding of the current situation before we propose any changes. Let's identify the most relevant data points to ensure our decision is based on facts.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I'm looking forward to this! Let's make sure we don't just make a plan that looks good on paper. I want to know if people are actually enjoying themselves and showing up!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Let's be realistic: ""fairness"" is usually just a word people use until they're the ones paying more. I'm interested in the actual usage patterns. Let's see who's actually showing up and who's just a name on a list.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minato,,"I'm curious about how much work goes into the books! I'll check the ""Outgoing treasurer's logged hours"" and the ""Last year's ledger of outgoings"" to see what the job is really like.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"I will examine the ""Bank statements on last year's renewals"" and the ""Tally of the sign-in sheets."" We need to know exactly how much revenue we can rely on and how many members are actually active.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minako,,"I will look into the ""Sign-up records for mid-year joiners"" and the ""Taster evening forms from non-joiners."" I want to understand how newcomers are integrating and what might be deterring others from joining.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"I want to see if the vibe is still there! I'll check the ""Weekday turnout since the summer outings"" and ""Quieter members at the winter social"" to see who's actually feeling the love!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll look into the ""Tally of the sign-in sheets"" and ""The rota against the attendance record."" I want to see exactly who is carrying the load and who is just coasting on the others' efforts.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minato,,"It's interesting that Ryuji and Shunichi are both checking the sign-in sheets! I wonder if they'll find the same things. I hope the treasurer's hours aren't too scary, because I'd hate for someone to be stressed.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Comparing notes on the sign-in sheets will be useful. I am less concerned with who is ""coasting"" and more concerned with the actual number of active members, as that directly impacts our projected revenue and budget stability.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minako,,"It is a good idea to cross-reference the attendance data. I am more interested in the barriers to entry for new members, as maintaining an open and welcoming atmosphere is essential for the club's longevity.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,"@Minato, don't be so worried! I'm sure the treasurer just needs a little bit of help. I'm more curious if our regulars are still as excited to come out as they used to be!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Ryuji, your focus on ""revenue"" is predictably dry. I'm more interested in the social friction. If a handful of people are doing all the work while others just pay a flat fee, that's a recipe for a grudge.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minato,,I hope we can find a way to make everyone happy! I'll stick with my choices and see what the treasurer's logs say. I'll see you all soon with the results!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will proceed with my research. It is essential that we base our figures on actual bank records rather than assumptions to ensure the club's financial stability. I will see you all in the next round.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Minako,,I will also begin my research. Understanding the perspective of those who joined mid-year or chose not to join at all will be key to keeping the club accessible. I will see you all soon.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,May,,I'm ready to go hunt for some clues! I'll find out if the energy is still high or if things have gone a bit stale. See you all soon with the juicy details! Bye-bye!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll be the one to bring the cold, hard truth to the table. Let's see if the data confirms my suspicions about who's actually doing the heavy lifting. See you all in the next round.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
